As a Qantas First customer, we’re dedicated to overseeing your Qantas travel and ensuring that you have the smoothest journey possible. 
<br/>
<p>
As part of the Qantas First Experience, we’d like to know if you require Qantas Porter Assistance for your luggage at the airport prior to your departure, or if you'd like to enquire about an appointment in the Qantas First Lounge Spa before your flight. <br/>
<p>If you would like to take up either of these Exclusive VIP Services, please respond to this email before 4pm the day prior to your departure and include the service you’d like to enquire about and the best contact phone number. One of our Relationship Specialists will then contact you to assist.</p>
Warm regards,<br/>
Qantas {!IF(QCC_First_Host__c.QCC_SSU_Formula__c = TRUE, "Special","VIP")} Service Team
